    "notes": "Flowers, GARDEN and LOADING ZONE tape, park zones, and game piece spawns are synced from official CAD positions (assets/seasons/biobuzz_2026/field_layout.json) by import-field-cad; pieces spawned inside a flower or above the tiles start staged. VERIFY: start slots were slid clear of the flower colliders, not taken from the manual. Lab backgroundAsset is tessellated from official am-5850 BIOBUZZ STEP (raw STEP stays in var/cad/, not committed). MuJoCo colliders remain schematic AABBs so robots can drive under the hive. VERIFY: hive x-offsets; tip threshold is scoring-side; AprilTag IDs 1–3, 4–6, 42–45 are inferred (manual extract only confirmed 0, 7, 38–41). POLLEN diameter 2.8 in per §9.8. Official field ~144 x 144 in inside perimeter. CAD general tolerance +/- 1 in."
